"""Framerate autoscaler (FUG-82): the pure `FpsController` that keeps effects at
a consistent FPS by adapting a 5-fps-ladder target to each effect's real
per-frame cost (5% headroom + an x/N missed-frame window), and aborts when even
25 fps (or a user-pinned rate) can't be held.

no_std, zero-dependency, integer-only (no hardware f64 on the C6) so it unit
tests on the host and compiles unchanged for the ESP32-C6. Driven by the render
loop through the player FFI (see //firmware/player_app:ffi.rs)."""

load("@rules_rust//rust:defs.bzl", "rust_library", "rust_test")

package(default_visibility = ["//visibility:public"])

rust_library(
    name = "fps",
    srcs = ["src/lib.rs"],
    crate_name = "ledmapper_fps",
    edition = "2021",
)

rust_test(
    name = "fps_test",
    crate = ":fps",
    edition = "2021",
)
